
@startuml
title LIBRORA - Borrowing Request State Diagram

[*] --> Pending : Student submits request

Pending --> Approved : Admin approves request
Pending --> Rejected : Admin rejects request

Approved --> Returned : Student returns book

Rejected --> [*]
Returned --> [*]

note right of Pending
  Waiting for admin decision
end note

note right of Approved
  Book is borrowed
end note

note right of Rejected
  Request was declined
end note

note right of Returned
  Book is available again
end note

@enduml
